{"id":"word:hebrew:H705","type":"word","title":"אַרְבָּעִים","subtitle":"H705 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"forty","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אַרְבָּעִים (H705) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 135 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אַרְבָּעִים (ʼarbâʻîym) means forty First listed occurrence: 1Chr 5 18."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אַרְבָּעִים","transliteration":"ʼarbâʻîym","pronunciation":"ar-baw-eem'","strong":"H705","lemmaId":"hebrew:H705","partOfSpeech":"n","forms":["אַרְבָּעִ֥ים","אַרְבָּעִ֣ים","וְ/אַרְבָּעִ֥ים","אַרְבָּעִ֖ים","וְ/אַרְבָּעִ֖ים"],"morphs":[["HAcbpa",93],["HC/Acbpa",36],["HTd/Acbpa",3],["HR/Acbpa",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"forty","usage":"forty.","full":"H705. arbaim אַרְבָּעִים 136 plural noun indeclinable a forty ; — 1 sine num. al.: a. usually apposition before noun, especially יוֺם שָׁנָה, (singular): שָׁנָה אַרְבָּעִים Judg 3:11 ; 1Sam 4:18 ; Amos 2:10 ; 5:25 29t.; ׳א יוֺם Gen 7:17 ; 1Kin 19:8 ; Jonah 3:4 6 t., ׳וְא לַיְלָה ׳א יוֺם Gen 7:4 , 12 ; Exod 24:18 7 t.; also ׳א בַּת 1Kin 7:38 , ׳א גָּמָל 2Kin 8:9 , ׳א אַמָּה Ezek 41:2 and ( אַמָּה omitted) 46:22 , but ׳א בָּאַמָּה 1Kin 6:17 (v: אַמָּה ); ׳א אֶלֶף Num 1:33 ; 2:19 ; 26:18 ; Josh 4:13 ; Judg 5:8 ; 2Sam 10:18 ; 1Kin 5:6 ; 1Chr 12:37 (van d. H. v. 12:36 ), 19:18 (see also below); rarely followed by plural noun, ׳א בָּנִים Judg 12:14 , ׳א אֲדָנִים Exod 26:19 , 21 ; 36:24 , 26 (P). — (As round number Gen 7:17 ; Judg 3:11 ; 5:31 ; 8:28 ; 1Sam 4:18 +). b. after plural noun , א ׳מָּרוֺת Gen 32:16 (E), א ׳שְׁקָלִים Neh 5:15 . c. noun omitted Gen 18:29 , ׳הָא 18:29 ; ׳א יַכֶּנּוּ Deut 25:3 forty (blows) may he smite him. 2 with other numbers: a. before unit, + singular noun:, 40 1 שָׁנָה 1Kin 14:21 ; 15:10 ; 2Kin 14:23 ; 402 שָׁנָה 2Chron 22:20, אִישׁ 10:14 , עִיר Num 35:6 , + אֶלֶף Judg 12:6 ; 405 שָׁנָה Josh 14:10 (JE), etc. (12 t.); + plural noun יְלָדִים 2Kin 2:24 ; after plural noun הָעַמּוּדִים 405 1Kin 7:3 ; noun omitted 40 5 Gen 18:28 , compare Ezra 2:24 = Neh 7:28 . b. after unit , 9 40 שָׁנָה Lev 25:8 (H); 1 40 אֶלֶף Num 1:41 ; 2:28 , etc. (9 t. Numbers, P). c. with hundreds, 40 שָׁנָה 800 שָׁנָה Gen 5:18 (P); 100 40 שָׁנָה Job 42:16 ; + units, 7 שָׁנִים 40100 שָׁנָה Gen 47:28 (P); but (Ezra Nehemiah, mostly predicate, without noun), 900 405 Ezra 2:8 , compare 2:25 ; Neh 7:62 , and ( ׳א without וְ ) 600, 40 2 Ezra 2:10 , see also || Neh 7:15 ; Ezra 2:34 = Neh 7:36 ; Ezra 2:66 = Neh 7:68 (ver. omitted Baer Gi), 7:13 , 29 , 44 ; Nehemiah 1000, 200, 40 7 Ezra 2:38 = Neh 7:41 ; plural noun 200 405 7:67 , plural noun 200, 40 + 2; 11:13 ; also singular noun נֶפֶשׁ 700, 40 5 Jer 52:30 . 3 as ordinal , ׳בְּא שָׁנָה Deut 1:3 in the fortieth year ; also הָא ׳בִּשְׁנַת Num 33:38 ; 1Chr 26:31 ; א ׳בִּשְׁנַת וְאַחַת 2Chr 16:13 in the forty-first year","rootNote":"multiple of 702 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 5 18","keyReferences":["1Chr 5 18","1Chr 12 37","1Chr 19 18","1Chr 26 31","1Chr 29 27","1Kgs 2 11","1Kgs 5 6","1Kgs 6 17"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":135,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 5 18","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְבָּעִ֨ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 37","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":37,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְבָּעִ֥ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 19 18","book":"1Chr","chapter":19,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אַרְבָּעִ֥ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 26 31","book":"1Chr","chapter":26,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָֽ/אַרְבָּעִ֜ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Acbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 29 27","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אַרְבָּעִ֖ים","source":